# Build artefacts of `scripts/serve-wasm.sh`.
#
# They are generated from `rustxWidgets/rswidgets` + `src` on every run, so
# committing them would commit a stale copy of the app: a `git status` full of
# a 6 MB `.wasm` after every build, and a reviewer with no way to tell whether
# the committed module still matches the source.
*.js
*.wasm
*.ts
